CM_ BU_ PARK "Parking assist sensors";
CM_ BO_ 605 "Driver assistance computer (primary) message: traffic control";
CM_ SG_ 605 APP_tcFeatureState "The feature level state of stopping for traffic controls";
CM_ SG_ 605 APP_tcStateMachine "The traffic control state machine's internal control state.";
CM_ SG_ 605 APP_tcControlSource "The input data source for the traffic control object";
CM_ SG_ 605 APP_tcControlType "The specific type of traffic control, note not all are control worthy.";
CM_ SG_ 605 APP_tcControlDistance "The distance to the nearest critical traffic control object; raw 255 = signal not available (SNA)";
CM_ SG_ 605 APP_tcControlLightState "Driver assistance computer (primary): tc control light state";
CM_ SG_ 605 APP_tcContinuationReason "The reason the traffic control state machine entered the continue state.";
