CM_ SG_ 605 APP_tcWarningSuppressionReason "The suppression reason for the traffic control warning feature.";
CM_ SG_ 605 APP_tcUnavailableReason "The reason why the traffic control feature is currently unavailable.";
CM_ SG_ 605 APP_tcVisionLight "Whether or not the traffic light has a vision measurement.";
